{-
   A library module carrying a test file of its own - Design-Test.md §3.1.

   Most of what this fixture asserts is not written in it: `modules/GlobalInit.test.yana` holds the
   case, and it runs here because a test file joins the suite of whatever compiled it. What is here
   is the other half - that the module's ordinary declarations still work from outside, and that a
   fixture importing one gets both.
-}
import GlobalInit
import Test

@test fn theModuleItself() -> {}:
    check(doubled(21) == 42)
